abstract: >
  FenotIT is desktop software for image-based plant phenotyping. It corrects
  photos (lens distortion, perspective, color and scale), segments objects such
  as seeds, pods and leaves, and measures their number, size, outline shape,
  color and spatial arrangement, for one photo or a batch, without programming.
  Results are exported as tables with the parameters used.
